# Models of Interactive Videodisc Development.

**Authors:** Hendricks, Harold H.

## Abstract
Over the past decade, Brigham Young University has developed many interactive videodisc programs for personalized foreign language instruction, from early prototypal projects to current HyperCard and Toolbook packages. A broad description of the different models, their variations, and their implementation is provided. (Contains seven references.) (Author/LB)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ477732

